Subject: [PATCH 07/33] WIP mmb: on-the-fly IQ4_XS (WTYPE 8) for dense +
 routed/GLU

- mmb_dq_row_iq4xs: 136-byte super-block, IQ4_NL nibble LUT with a 6-bit
  sub-block scale split across scales_h/scales_l
- Q3_K_M (down experts IQ4_XS): +1.3%/+1.1%, PPL 14.6517->14.6234 (parity)
- MiniMax-M3 UD-IQ4_XS now fully covered: IQ3_S 56% + IQ4_XS 35% + Q8_0 + Q6_K
